   "title": "The Empire fragments",
   "date": "4–6 ABY",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "Without Palpatine the Moffs become warlords — Zsinj in the Quelii oversector, Isard on Coruscant, a dozen admirals with a dozen fleets. The New Republic grows from Endor along the trade routes: Bothawui, Sullust, Mon Calamari, Kashyyyk, and every world that was waiting for permission to leave.",
