  {
   "title": "Coruscant, and Thrawn",
   "date": "7–9 ABY",
   "view": {
    "focus": "Coruscant",
    "w": 3200
   },
   "text": "Rogue Squadron takes Coruscant; the bacta war over Thyferra follows. Then Grand Admiral Thrawn returns from the Unknown Regions with clones from Wayland and a fleet raised at Sluis Van and Bilbringi, and for a year the New Republic loses every engagement it fights — until a Noghri bodyguard ends him.",
