  {
   "title": "The Pellaeon–Gavrisom Treaty",
   "date": "19 ABY",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "After Daala's warlord purge and the Caamas crisis, Admiral Pellaeon signs the peace at Bastion: the Imperial Remnant keeps eight sectors in the Outer Rim, and the New Republic keeps everything else. Beyond the map's edge the Chiss keep their own counsel, as they have since Thrawn.",
